1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:04,541
Part Three: Risk for Allergic Reaction

2
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,583
With any cream, lotion or medication,

3
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:12,500
there is always risk for allergic reaction.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,083
An allergic reaction is an overreaction

5
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:17,833
of the immune system to a harmless product

6
00:00:18,041 --> 00:00:22,250
 or product that would not normally result
in an immune response.

7
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:30,458
Allergic reaction to moisturizer, silver cream,
or even padding is possible.

8
00:00:30,458 --> 00:00:33,208
Symptoms can include itching and rash.

9
00:00:33,541 --> 00:00:35,000
If that happens,

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,333
let your doctor and their team know
immediately, and we will stop whichever

11
00:00:39,333 --> 00:00:44,333
agent that we think is triggering the
reaction and switch to a different cream.
